  "title": "Rinny&#39;s Cavatappi Salad",
  "description": "Rinny&#39;s cavatappi salad recipe is a classic macaroni salad made with cavatappi, tuna, ham, bell pepper, Cheddar, and a creamy dressing with pickle juice.",
